<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Ms. Keller returns for her six-month review through a qualified tactile interpreter. She has had no falls. The occupational therapist visited in July: handrails are now on both sides of every step, tactile edge strips are on the steps, her smoke and carbon monoxide alarms now shake her bed, and she wears an alert button. She finished physical therapy in June and exercises daily. Her August cystitis cleared within three days on nitrofurantoin; during those nights she used the bedside rail and did not fall. She has made a second speaking trip. She notices no change in the feeling in her fingers. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Interval change</td><td>No falls in six months</td></tr><tr><td>Home changes</td><td>Occupational therapy visit in July; all changes installed</td></tr><tr><td>Exercise</td><td>Daily home program</td></tr><tr><td>Recent illness</td><td>Cystitis in August, resolved</td></tr><tr><td>Touch</td><td>No change in finger sensation</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

